      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "所有类型"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "All of this iPhone's Apple Health history will be uploaded again. The server ignores duplicates.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "将重新上传此 iPhone 的全部 Apple 健康历史数据，服务器会忽略重复数据。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "All samples, statistics and write requests on the server will be deleted, and this iPhone's Apple Health history will be uploaded again. Keys are kept. Apple Health on this iPhone is not affected.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "服务器上的所有样本、统计数据和写入请求将被删除，随后重新上传此 iPhone 的 Apple 健康历史数据。密钥将保留。此 iPhone 上的 Apple 健康数据不受影响。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Allow": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "允许"
          }
        }
      }
    },
